    "product_faq_iXcLnC": {
      "type": "product-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_Fq7LBp": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product"
          }
        },
        "tab_content_683zbz": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is it compatible with iPhone cases?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes, the RORRY AuraDock 4-in-1 Charging Station is compatible with iPhones in cases. It uses MagSafe technology and includes a magnetic reinforcement ring that you can attach to your iPhone case for a stronger magnetic connection if needed.Your iPhone will charge securely whether it's in a case or not, as long as the case isn't excessively thick (standard cases work great).</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_fjWWzA": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>How long is the charging time?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>The RORRY AuraDock 4-in-1 Charging Station charges quickly:</p><p>•<strong>iPhone</strong>: Fully charged in 3 hours (reaches 40% in just 30 minutes with the 20W USB-C adapter)</p><p>•<strong>Power bank</strong>: Fully charged in 3 hours</p><p>•<strong>All devices together</strong>: iPhone, Apple Watch, and AirPods all charge simultaneously in 3 hours</p><p>Note: While your phone is on the dock, the detachable power bank won't charge—you'll need to remove your phone first to charge the power bank separately.<br/><br/></p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_Wrb3qd": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is the charging station suitable for travel?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Absolutely. Its foldable design saves space in your bag, and the detachable magnetic power bank lets you take portable power with you wherever you go. It's ideal for home, the office, and travel.<br/></p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_KQRxtY": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can it charge Android phones?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>The magnetic wireless charging function is designed for MagSafe-compatible iPhones. Other Qi-compatible devices may charge wirelessly if properly aligned, but magnetic attachment and optimal performance are not guaranteed.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_NVT3iN": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can I use the detachable power bank by itself?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes! The 5,000mAh magnetic power bank is fully detachable and can be used independently for charging your compatible iPhone while you're away from your desk. It stays charged while docked, making it perfect for daily commuting or short trips.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_rjgjrP": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can the power bank be charged while my iPhone is attached to the charging stand?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>No. When your iPhone is magnetically attached to the charging stand, the charging dock prioritizes charging your phone. To recharge the detachable 5,000mAh power bank itself, simply remove your iPhone from the stand.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_pyUjBg": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can I charge four devices at the same time?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The charging station can charge:</p><ul><li>One iPhone</li><li>One Apple Watch</li><li>One pair of AirPods</li><li>The built-in detachable 5,000mAh magnetic power bank (when the phone is not attached)</li></ul><p>This gives you a complete 4-in-1 charging solution.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        }
      },
